  "steps": [
    "Put the potatoes in a pan of salted water, bring to the boil, and simmer for 12 to 15 minutes until just tender. Drain and let them cool slightly.",
    "Boil the eggs for 8 to 9 minutes for set yolks, then cool under cold water, peel, and halve.",
    "While the potatoes cook, blanch the green beans in boiling salted water for 3 to 4 minutes until bright green and tender-crisp. Drain and rinse briefly under cold water.",
    "Whisk the olive oil, lemon juice, mustard, salt, and black pepper into a simple dressing.",
    "Arrange the rocket on a large platter or divide between plates. Add the potatoes, green beans, cherry tomatoes, red onion, olives, and tuna.",
    "Nestle the egg halves on top, drizzle with the dressing, and serve right away.",
